            fixed by typing the body as `BodyOf<NoInfer<D>>` (code:packages/flow-state-v3/src/machine.ts); `const B` and
            curried `machine(D)(body)` were rejected. A Held timer restored under a build with no pause reasons never
            fires, and one key's firing must not clear another key's issue (both closed by @task.V3.T118). Coverage runs
