            code:packages/flow-state-v3/src/host/testing/run.ts#reopen; `heldWrites` in 28 files (renamed `inflight` in
            one edit). Do not delete it before its replacement lands and the suite passes.

            **Risk:** hostile defaults can turn many existing Stories red; each red is replayed and its wrong side named
